	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Es wirt euch der uberruter ain ledle zuͦstellen, das wellt, sob
					<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sampt den brieffen gen <placeName>Elota</placeName> schicken dem vogt. wa ir aber
					<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nitt bald bottschafft ze haben wissten, so schickts dem <persName>Marcell</persName>
					<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>selbs gen Ror by aigner bottschafft.
					<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Si fieri ulla ratione potest, fac mox interim describatur, refert
					<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>enim nostra, ut quamprimum remittatur. Fiet autem istuc facile, si
					<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Quinque autem sex adolescentes operas describendi inter se partiant
					<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>tum enim dicbus aut tribus horis nullo negocio omnia absolverint.
					<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Ego nisi tam certus fuisset nuncius, hic describi curassam, post
					<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>dies aliquot tibi missurus exemplum, sed quum superioribus literis
					<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>significaris te istic valde desyderare, nolui dutius dffere
					<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>zu 1548. duni.
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
